<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρό-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρός</span>) poet.
		word, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>countryman, rustic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1270
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Anth.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάροινος ἀ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρα</span>) <i>hunter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰωνοί . . οἷσί τε τέκνα ἀγρόται
					ἐξείλοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.218
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				23.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρότα Πάν</span>, to whom
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτυα ἀπ᾽ ἀγρεσίης</span> are
			offered, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.13
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>):—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρότις</span></b> , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.509
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κούρα</span>, i.e. Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.111
			</span></i> (Antip.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. αἰγανέη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			for <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1002
			</span></i>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρέτης</span>
			.</div>
